world_state_changes:
  - Ash Giants are numerically and physiologically crippled post-ritual (43 participated; 29 conscious; ~15 functional). :contentReference[oaicite:9]{index=9}
  - Enlil offers explicit collaborator contract: resources/healing/territory/security in exchange for cooperation and intelligence. 
  - The tribe votes to accept (23–6). :contentReference[oaicite:11]{index=11}
  - Betrayal is deliberately exposed via unsecured Needle surveillance message, escalating mistrust across all tribes. 
  - Pazuzu states the high-level outcome: Sundering becomes effectively permanent and will poison every future crisis response. 
  - Queen departs satisfied: tactical losses acceptable; strategic objective achieved (fragmentation). :contentReference[oaicite:14]{index=14}
